From 87da05d69c177ec7c8ea4cdd61509802019690e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:34:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Pad: replace the fixed touch icons with the red Odyssey image
 set

The touch gamepad's fixed icons are now the red Odyssey image set
(dm/ios/Sources/PadIcons/*.png, bundled as resources) instead of the
grey translucent vector shapes: red buttons with white labels, a red
stick ring with a gold skyline and a Cappy hat, a cream knob, white
arrows on the D-pad arms, and a gold ship by the diamond. Each image
is drawn at 4x point size so it stays sharp on 3x Retina; the layer
frame is the button's bounding box grown by 1/fill so the artwork
lands exactly on the geometry (DmPadGeometry.h, unchanged, still owns
positions and hit-testing). The icons never change on press; only the
left stick's knob moves. No settings toggle: this is the fixed set.
